y}=\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{y}_{i}$ are the means of the data sets.\n\nTherefore, the covariance of our data sets is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}(x,y) & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(6-6)(4-9)+(4-6)(7-9)+(8-6)(11-9)+(6-6)(14-9)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[(0)(-5)+(-2)(-2)+(2)(2)+(0)(5)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[0+4+4+0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501547 #edb/ref 1080 "-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501547 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501547 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2d9c6ba6-69a9-5ee8-9708-70c11ce21cc5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501556 #edb/ref 1080 "1.5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501556 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501556 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "31a13e4e-c027-5991-a7d1-412a4ff0c00e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501581 #edb/ref 1080 "2.5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501581 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501581 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3f2b6eb8-c4d1-56b2-89dc-4001ee07443f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501681 #edb/ref 1080 "-2.5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501681 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501681 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "74ac785e-85e2-5e6e-bc31-bcc9001443e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501912 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501912 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186501912 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "decfb95f-7b91-5304-b64a-c323fdf22255" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186502034 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186501547 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186502034 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186501556 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186502034 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186501581 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186502034 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186501681 #edb/ref 17592186045417]